        "TileImage": "$($repository a7955c8b-ae26-4418-b788-c25b89e23f5b).Image",
        "Description": "This one is a peculiar one, she is known to the group as Crazy_Sunshine, and yes the underscore is needed. At first we weren’t sure ourselves what she contributed to the group, but after some surveillance 47 we found a pistol the size of a rifle, as well as some tech we have never seen before….is that a robot? We can’t let this side, even if she was the one who killed the departed, take her out before she checks out of the hotel, she may have been the gunman...",
